<title>UK: BOE allots 80 mln stg in repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 80 mln stg in repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted 80 million stg in repo at an unchanged rate of 6.5 percent, to help alleviate a forecast 850 million stg liquidity shortage in the UK money market.</p>
<p>The repos are to July 7.</p>
</text>
